Equip the Stim \- Cure for those moments when every second counts, offering a fighting chance against deadly poisons, diseases, and even the finality of death, turning the tide in the most hopeless situations.
Effects
\-- Stim with Uses(6), cures poison/disease at Sk(50)^; one use per target per incident.
\-- If administered shortly after death, allows immediate Death Check at For(\*\*2)^(-Vit+minutes dead).', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iqPvm0SIApZlBGz-YAjYtNALag-VD2NK/view?usp=drive_link', '2026-08-13T21:26:28.538529+00:00') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
Visually, the Stim \- Action is a small, sleek injector containing a vibrant liquid that glows faintly, hinting at the energy-boosting potential within. The injector is designed for quick and easy use, fitting comfortably in the hand and allowing for rapid administration in the heat of battle. Once administered, the user feels an immediate surge of energy, heightening their senses and quickening their reflexes. The stim’s effects are short-lived but intense, providing just enough time to make a critical difference in the outcome of a situation.
Enhance your combat effectiveness with the Stim \- Action, giving you the extra edge you need when time is of the essence, and every action could mean the difference between victory and defeat.
Effects
\-- Only 1 action stim works per Event.', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iqPvm0SIApZlBGz-YAjYtNALag-VD2NK/view?usp=drive_link', '2026-08-13T21:26:28.538529+00:00') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
